---
source: crates/runtime/tests/models/search.rs
description: "SELECT id, answer, trunc(_score, 3) as _score FROM vector_search(qs_view, 'secondary') where subject!='math' order by _score desc, id LIMIT 4"
---
+---------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
+---------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Sort: _score DESC NULLS FIRST, vector_search(qs_view, Utf8("secondary")).id ASC NULLS LAST, fetch=4                                                                                                                                       |
|               |   Projection: vector_search(qs_view, Utf8("secondary")).id, vector_search(qs_view, Utf8("secondary")).answer, trunc(vector_search(qs_view, Utf8("secondary"))._score, Int64(3)) AS _score                                                 |
|               |     Filter: vector_search(qs_view, Utf8("secondary")).subject != Utf8("math")                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |       Projection: vector_search(qs_view, Utf8("secondary"))._score, vector_search(qs_view, Utf8("secondary")).answer, vector_search(qs_view, Utf8("secondary")).id, vector_search(qs_view, Utf8("secondary")).subject                     |
|               |         SearchTelemetry                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |           SubqueryAlias: vector_search(qs_view, Utf8("secondary"))                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |             Projection: search_index._score, search_index.answer, search_index.answer_embedding, search_index.id, search_index.question, base_table.reference_answer, base_table.source, search_index.subject                             |
|               |               Sort: search_index._score DESC NULLS FIRST                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                 Projection: search_index.id, search_index.question, search_index.answer, search_index.subject, search_index.answer_embedding, search_index._score, base_table.reference_answer, base_table.source                         |
|               |                   Left Join: search_index.id = base_table.id                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                     SubqueryAlias: search_index                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |                       SubqueryAlias: search_index                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |                         Projection: CAST(tbl.key AS Int64) AS id, tbl.question, tbl.answer, tbl.subject, tbl.data AS answer_embedding, Float64(1) - tbl.distance AS _score                                                                |
|               |                           TableScan: tbl                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                     Projection: base_table.id, base_table.reference_answer, base_table.source                                                                                                                                             |
|               |                       TableScan: base_table projection=[id, reference_answer, source]                                                                                                                                                     |
| physical_plan | SortPreservingMergeExec: [_score@2 DESC, id@0 ASC NULLS LAST], fetch=4                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |   SortExec: TopK(fetch=4), expr=[_score@2 DESC, id@0 ASC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[true]                                                                                                                                        |
|               |     ProjectionExec: expr=[id@2 as id, answer@1 as answer, trunc(_score@0, 3) as _score]                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |       FilterExec: subject@3 != math, projection=[_score@0, answer@1, id@2]                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |         ProjectionExec: expr=[_score@0 as _score, answer@1 as answer, id@3 as id, subject@7 as subject]                                                                                                                                   |
|               |           SearchTelemetryExec                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |             RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(3), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |               ProjectionExec: expr=[_score@5 as _score, answer@2 as answer, answer_embedding@4 as answer_embedding, id@0 as id, question@1 as question, reference_answer@6 as reference_answer, source@7 as source, subject@3 as subject] |
|               |                 HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Left, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(id@0, id@0)], projection=[id@0, question@1, answer@2, subject@3, answer_embedding@4, _score@5, reference_answer@7, source@8]      |
|               |                   CoalescePartitionsExec                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                     ProjectionExec: expr=[CAST(key@4 AS Int64) as id, question@0 as question, answer@1 as answer, subject@2 as subject, data@3 as answer_embedding, 1 - distance@5 as _score]                                             |
|               |                       RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(3), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                         CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |                           BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                             S3VectorsQueryExec (INDEX_NAME_1): limit=100                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                   SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |                     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |                       DataSourceExec: partitions=1, partition_sizes=[2]                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
+---------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
